      "line": 85,
      "purpose": "`<ui-accordion>`:  A panel is about to open;  `preventDefault()` keeps it closed.  NOT cancelable in effect when the browser opened it itself (find-in-page).  Cancelable.  Detail:  `{ index: number, open: true, title: Element, content?: Element, originalEvent?: Event }`.",
      "current": "ui-open",
      "recommended": "opening"
    },
    {
      "id": "ui-accordion-ui-close",
      "section": "ui-folds",
      "file": "spell-ui/src/components/ui-accordion/UIAccordion.en.ts",
      "line": 93,
      "purpose": "`<ui-accordion>`:  A panel is about to close -- its title was activated, or another panel is opening in an `exclusive` accordion;  `preventDefault()` keeps it open (and then the other one closed).  Cancelable.  Detail:  `{ index: number, open: false, title: Element, content?: Element, originalEvent?: Event }`.",
      "current": "ui-close",
      "recommended": "closing"
    },
